{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Near Miss</i>, you are tasked with protecting your planet from a relentless barrage of asteroids hurtling towards it from all directions. As the commander of the planet\u2019s defences, you must place and upgrade a variety of unique towers to hold off the asteroid menace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your defences around the planet, utilizing different tower types and upgrades to intercept and destroy incoming asteroids. The stakes get higher the longer you survive. Can you master the art of balancing resources and keep your planet safe?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Placement</strong>: Position towers in optimal locations to maximize defence efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong>: Improve your towers with improved abilities to counter tougher enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Tower Types</strong>: Choose from a variety of towers, each with its own strengths and weaknesses against different types of asteroids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your defences in this battle for survival! Will you rise to the challenge, or will the asteroids claim victory?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051980?t=1764538159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051980?t=1764538159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051980/c3797c044e7f8f7fbee4900ef5456e4783fa8cf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764538159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051980/c3797c044e7f8f7fbee4900ef5456e4783fa8cf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764538159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"desc